  "description": {
   "en": "Arim has the ability to read other people’s minds through physical contact. One day, he accidentally touches Taehun, his crush, and ends up reading his thoughts…\n“I want to touch Arim…”\n“Should I just strip her and hold him right here?”\nArim is utterly shocked when he realize that Taehun, who always seemed so kind and gentle, has been having such lewd thoughts about him.\n“I can’t believe someone as warm as him is imagining something so dirty…”\n“But why…? Even though I know I shouldn’t, I keep feeling it.”"
